  I believe that this is a god of the hunt of Finish mythology.
He is supposed to have a hunting pack of hounds (the howling that you
hear).  You will either be the object of the hunt (i.e. alignment is
chaotic) or will be forced to join the hunt, where your hit points 
will be drained do to exhaustion.  I don't know what would have called
the hunt to your location (phase of moon?) but it is not a pleasent
experience.  The god CwnAnnwn is neutral, if I remember correcty.  
  I may be wrong, since it has been quite a while since I have read
this information, and I have the wrong god, or this may just be some-
thing completly unrelated.
